\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1765</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/6a1932313801e55fbcfb047fdcef87266f472c33\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">6a19323</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(announcer)</i> Block browser by checking the User-Agent (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1764\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1764</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/7b64b508199af568472fe6ac2edf333a3e274a00\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">7b64b50</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(announcer)</i> Block User-Agent strings that are too long (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1763\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1763</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/a98f8f102a8253b0b22c80ef444fed1ec29177f3\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">a98f8f1</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(announcer)</i> Blocking all ports lower then 1024 (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1762\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1762</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/1bc7e09ddbeaf680b86095eed9a80b8ebf6169b3\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">1bc7e09</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(cache)</i> Checking if extensions are installed (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1759\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1759</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/7f31022cfca2acb28a5cba06961eeaf8d2c9de51\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">7f31022</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(captcha)</i> Added some new services 🤖 (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1771\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1771</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/d413c717188c9bd906f715e7137955dc9a42a003\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">d413c71</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(environment)</i> Make configurable TP_HOST and TP_PORT (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1780\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1780</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/e51e09159333382a77b809b5f1da5e152a713143\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">e51e091</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(installer)</i> Fully show non-installed extensions (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1761\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1761</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/8fcc62d2a2fd41927b2f5dae215fe5bbf95f2c96\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">8fcc62d</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(installer)</i> More explanations (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1758\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">#1758</a>) - (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/commit/48ab52ac8674afcb607c8e49134316a3e117236a\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\">48ab52a</a>)</li>\n<li data-xf-list-type=\"ul\"><i>(installer)</i> Check Composer dependencies after installing (<a href=\"https://github.com/torrentpier/torrentpier/pull/1756\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"link link--external\" rel=\"nofollow ugc noopener\